        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Twelfth United States Army Group, Joint Chiefs of Staff\n- People: Omar Bradley\n- Places: London\n- Roles: Commander, Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff\n- Events: Korean War\n\nFacts:\n- The Twelfth United States Army Group established its headquarters in London on 14 July 1944.\n- General Omar Bradley commanded the Twelfth United States Army Group.\n- Omar Bradley was the first Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff.\n- As Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff, Omar Bradley oversaw U.S. military policy-making during the Korean War.",
